[{"answer":"Hi.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Good afternoon.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Come on in.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/4.mp3"},{"answer":"So, what can I help you with today?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I want to join the bicycle club.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Joining clubs is a great thing to do.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Unfortunately, the bicycle club currently has no events","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/8.mp3"},{"answer":"because the office is being renovated.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh... well, when is it going to be done?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/10.mp3"},{"answer":"The anticipated date of completion is next semester,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/11.mp3"},{"answer":"though it could take as long as a year.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Wow... that's a long time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/13.mp3"},{"answer":"That's a bummer.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/14.mp3"},{"answer":"I do apologize.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/15.mp3"},{"answer":"It's not your fault, I guess.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Umm... so are there other clubs I can join instead?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Absolutely.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/18.mp3"},{"answer":"There are a wide variety of clubs throughout campus.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Since you were interested in the bicycle club,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/20.mp3"},{"answer":"I would recommend the hiking club or rock climbing club.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/21.mp3"},{"answer":"They are popular options for students who are interested in exercising and meeting friends.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Those could be nice.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/23.mp3"},{"answer":"It's too bad about the bicycle club, though.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/24.mp3"},{"answer":"But, yeah, those would work.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/25.mp3"},{"answer":"How about the hiking club, when is it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/26.mp3"},{"answer":"The hiking club meets Friday evenings.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/27.mp3"},{"answer":"That won't work then.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/28.mp3"},{"answer":"I have biology class on Friday night.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/29.mp3"},{"answer":"I didn't think finding a club would be this hard.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/30.mp3"},{"answer":"Don't get discouraged.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/31.mp3"},{"answer":"It's all about finding the right fit.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/32.mp3"},{"answer":"In the future, the bicycle club's office will be finished and they will start up again.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/33.mp3"},{"answer":"You won't always have biology on Friday nights either.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/34.mp3"},{"answer":"What about the rock climbing club?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/35.mp3"},{"answer":"I do really like climbing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/36.mp3"},{"answer":"When is that one?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/37.mp3"},{"answer":"Let's see...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/38.mp3"},{"answer":"the rock climbing club meets Tuesday afternoons.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/39.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay... okay yeah,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/40.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't have any class or anything going on then.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/41.mp3"},{"answer":"So you'd like to join the rock climbing club?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/42.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, please!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/43.mp3"},{"answer":"Alright.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/44.mp3"},{"answer":"So, the process isn't too complicated.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/45.mp3"},{"answer":"You just have to pay the dues, which aren't very large,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/46.mp3"},{"answer":"and then fill out your contact information and attend the next meeting.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/47.mp3"},{"answer":"Is it going to be their first ever meeting?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/48.mp3"},{"answer":"Like, will I be that strange new person that nobody knows?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/49.mp3"},{"answer":"It is not their first meeting,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/50.mp3"},{"answer":"but you really don't need to worry.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/51.mp3"},{"answer":"The whole point of clubs is that they're social and welcoming to new people.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/52.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm sure you'll fit right in.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/53.mp3"},{"answer":"That's easy to say, but what if I don't?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/54.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, thinking negatively like that will only hurt your chances.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/55.mp3"},{"answer":"So first, try to stay positive.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/56.mp3"},{"answer":"They will probably ask you to introduce yourself,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/57.mp3"},{"answer":"so they can get to know you a little bit and you'll be good from there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/58.mp3"},{"answer":"Stuff like that makes me nervous.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/59.mp3"},{"answer":"It's perfectly normal to be nervous.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/60.mp3"},{"answer":"But remember, everybody there was the new person at some point.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/61.mp3"},{"answer":"But, if for some reason it doesn't work out for you,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/62.mp3"},{"answer":"you can always come back to me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/63.mp3"},{"answer":"There are plenty of clubs for all kinds of people.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/64.mp3"},{"answer":"And like I said before,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/65.mp3"},{"answer":"you may be able to join the hiking or bicycle club in the future.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/66.mp3"},{"answer":"But I should still try this now?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/67.mp3"},{"answer":"Of course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/68.mp3"},{"answer":"There are no guarantees","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/69.mp3"},{"answer":"and one of the major aspects of college is going out and trying new things.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/discuss-bicycle-club-2023-08-23-17-47-17/70.mp3"}]
